Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:40.16,Default,,0,0,10,,《黑夜传说5：血战》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:40.16,Default,,0,0,10,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,10,,(密码正确 允许进入中庭)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.97,1:02:54.61,Default,,0,0,10,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.60,0:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛琳来了 - 我同时被吸血鬼和狼人追杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Selene's coming! - I am hunted by vampires and Lycans.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.54,0:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他也不是维克托的追随者 - 侵略者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He had no love for Viktor, either. - Intruder.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.60,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 狼人 - 侵略者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lycans. - Intruder.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:26.18,0:58:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我解救了你 - 看看这双眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I freed you. - Look at the eyes.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:18.74,1:16:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马吕斯 - 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marius. - Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.18,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是吸血鬼军团的精兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was an elite soldier in the vampire army.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,死神使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Death Dealer.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.31,0:01:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时所向披靡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was good at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.35,0:01:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我遭人背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was betrayed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.08,0:01:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,维克托 我所效忠的领袖 帝国最有权势之人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor, our leader and the most powerful vampire...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.85,0:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,却并非我一心追随的救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was not the saviour he had led me to believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一夜之间 盟友变为仇敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly, allies turned enemies.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.36,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾誓死守卫的吸血鬼长老们 不肯让我活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vampire Elders I had once protected wanted me dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我遇到了迈克尔·柯文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I found Michael Corvin.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.29,0:01:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上既流着吸血鬼的血 也流着狼人的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither vampire nor Lycan, Michael became a hybrid.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.41,0:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起复仇 杀了那些长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We retaliated, killed the Elders.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.64,0:01:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但一切随之天翻地覆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then everything changed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.10,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我被俘获 当时并不知晓自己已经怀了迈克尔的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was captured, not knowing that I was carrying Michael's child.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.80,0:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 我们的女儿 第一个纯种的混血儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve, our daughter, the first pure-blood hybrid...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.31,0:01:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她的血可以结束战争…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whose blood could end the war...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.28,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,受到吸血鬼和狼人的觊觎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...became highly sought after by both vampires and Lycans alike.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.10,0:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能把她藏起来 让自己与世人都不知她的去向…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only choice was to hide her from the world and from myself...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.92,0:02:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这样即便是我也不能带人找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so not even I could lead them to her.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是吸血鬼军队的精兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was an elite soldier in the vampire army.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能把她藏起来 让自己与世人都不知她的去向…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only choice was to hide her from the world...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.08,0:02:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这样即便是我也不能带人找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so not even I could lead them to her.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我已活了许久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lived beyond my time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.12,0:02:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一千年后的新月对我来说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another new moon in 1000 years of new moons...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I do not care to see it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.60,0:02:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.64,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的族人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My coven...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.38,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my daughter...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我所爱之人都离我而去 - 杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...my love, all gone. - Cut her off!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.61,0:03:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不久后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And soon, perhaps...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.28,0:03:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my very existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我逃亡在外 如同一只丧家犬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I am an outcast, a pariah.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,B岗一号 结束 有车开过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo one, over. Car approaching.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准许进入 - 关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Access cleared. - Close the gates.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开始眼膜扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing perimeter sweep.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,黎明预警 一分钟后日出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn alert. 60 seconds to sunrise.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.31,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,侵略者 侵略者 侵略者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder. Intruder. Intruder.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,侵略者 侵略者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder. Intruder.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我方机动车驶入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tango Charlie approaching.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.91,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发现异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All clear.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.76,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,周边安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter secure.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:07.18,0:33:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,黎明预警 一分钟后日出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn alert. 60 seconds to sunrise.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:22.57,0:37:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,四号站台停靠的那辆列车 已经到达终点站了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The train at platform four terminates at this station.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:59.41,0:50:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:10.38,0:50:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我将我们的儿子取名为大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I name our son David.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.40,0:50:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.14,0:50:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天你会明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, you will understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.06,0:50:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真的抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.08,0:58:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.82,0:58:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是谁？你不知道我是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I am? Do you not know who I am?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:31.95,0:58:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的女儿 - 我不想看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My daughter. - I don't want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:33.88,0:58:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look for me.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:24.96,1:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请赞美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise the day...
Dialogue: 1,1:00:28.00,1:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,日暮时分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when it ends.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.92,1:00:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,请赞美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise the ice...
Dialogue: 1,1:00:32.56,1:00:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,承重的冰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when it holds.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:34.54,1:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,请赞美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise the sword...
Dialogue: 1,1:00:36.84,1:00:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,杀戮的宝剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when it kills.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:40.13,1:00:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请赞美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Praise the life...
Dialogue: 1,1:00:42.68,1:00:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,活过的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that has lived.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:50.55,1:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾米莉亚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia...
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.23,1:01:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,水流便是通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water is the path.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:40.48,1:02:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大门处安全 眼膜扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gate secure. Perimeter check.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.32,1:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 东门安全 - 西门安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- East gate is clear. - West gate clear.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.51,1:02:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开始眼膜扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing perimeter sweep.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.40,1:02:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,允许进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access granted.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:27.89,1:04:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,黎明预警 一分钟后日出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn alert. 60 seconds to sunrise.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.49,1:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,发现闯入者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breach detected.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.10,1:07:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安全系统启动 - 是狼人 他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Security system engaged. - Lycans. They're here.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.48,1:07:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,安全系统启动 发现闯入者 安全系统…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security system engaged. Breach detected. Security system...
Dialogue: 1,1:19:10.34,1:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的家人 是我唯一的牵挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're family, and you're all I have left.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:12.46,1:19:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not know who I am?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.25,1:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在最黑暗的时刻 我们打了最光辉的一仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fought our greatest battle in our darkest hour.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:48.39,1:20:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼和狼人几个世纪以来纷争不断…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After centuries of war between vampire and Lycan...
Dialogue: 1,1:20:51.88,1:20:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,和平终于降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this may at last be a time of peace.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:56.46,1:20:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要再次照顾好伤员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must once again tend to our wounded...
Dialogue: 1,1:20:59.15,1:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,纪念死去的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...honour our fallen.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:00.72,1:21:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,最后剩下的两个部族必须团结一致 找回力量…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our final two covens must find strength and unity...
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.63,1:21:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,才能浴火重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to heal and rise from the ashes.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:13.88,1:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的旅途也算圆满了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My journey has now come full circle.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:16.32,1:21:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾沦为逃犯 如今被选为三大长老之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once an outcast, I am now one of three chosen Elders.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.50,1:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,从亡命之徒到拥有至高无上的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From hunted to the highest honour.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:48.42,1:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经活了一千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lived 1000 years.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:50.74,1:21:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我会再活一千年…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may live 1000 more...
Dialogue: 1,1:21:53.44,1:21:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我明天就会死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or I may die tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:58.33,1:22:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不再畏惧死亡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I no longer fear death...
Dialogue: 1,1:22:00.89,1:22:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已死过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for I have known it once already.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:06.71,1:22:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我得以重生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am reborn...
Dialogue: 1,1:22:08.27,1:22:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我已见证过神圣世界…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and my eyes have been opened to the Sacred World...
Dialogue: 1,1:22:11.36,1:22:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看到过未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and to the promise of what is yet to be.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:16.95,1:22:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no beginning.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:19.39,1:22:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no end.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:22.46,1:22:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只有过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only becoming.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.20,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放她下来 - 记住 他想留个活口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put her down! - Remember, he wants her alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.16,0:03:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, now. Fire!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.51,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追你追得好辛苦啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are an extremely difficult person to keep track of.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.24,0:04:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不用你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.63,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但还是谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.77,0:04:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么话要带给迈克尔吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any word with Michael?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.89,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别再跟着我了 - 我没跟着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop tracking me! - I'm not tracking you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找到伊芙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Eve.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.48,0:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,全天下我是最不可能知道 我女儿行踪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm the very last person who could help you find my daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.24,0:04:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳 听我说 狼人又有动作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene, listen to me. The Lycans are moving again.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这次不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this is different.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.20,0:05:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们组织有方 他们有了新的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're organised. They have a new leader.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他叫马吕斯 - 我不愿再被牵扯到战争中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His name is Marius. - I'm finished with this war.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.60,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可你躲不开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not finished with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.30,0:05:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们本来应该把你杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could have killed you...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但很明显他们的任务是活捉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but clearly their mission was to capture you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.00,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿的血极其珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter's blood, it's a prize.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.92,0:05:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们找到了她 如果她的血被他们利用…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if they find her, if they use it...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.41,0:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯就天下无敌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Marius's power will be limitless.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那我还是希望她不被找到吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then I hope she remains lost.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,替我给马吕斯带个话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to deliver a message.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明白的话哼一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grunt if you understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉马吕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your Marius,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.39,0:05:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他自以为能从我身上获得什么信息…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he thinks he can extract information from me...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.27,0:05:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,以便找到我女儿 那他打错算盘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to locate my daughter, he can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.43,0:05:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道她在哪儿 我也不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where she is, and I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.08,0:05:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯会找到你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius will find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解自己要传达什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand your message?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.26,0:05:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前见过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen this before?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.61,0:05:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们得把它弄出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we need to get it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.53,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.15,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 很荣幸终于可以迎接您回府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Privilege to welcome you home at last, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.32,0:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉在她的私人房间等您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semira awaits you in her private chambers.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semira?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Cassius?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.43,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 所有委员会成员都欢迎您回来 先生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire council will greet you, of course, sir...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.16,0:07:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但塞米拉想单独见见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but Semira requests just a few moments.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your name is?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.79,0:07:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.49,0:07:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall try to remember it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,见机行事 因为这次悲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and act accordingly because of this tragic...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.11,0:07:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们单独待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.56,0:07:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的托马斯 咱们多久…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling Thomas. It has been...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没见了？- 几十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...how long? - Decades.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.57,0:07:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你进了委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gather you have a seat on the council.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我感到无比骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not be more proud.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.44,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜你的回归并不是因为有喜事相报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame that your return is not under more festive circumstances.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.64,0:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,据说西支吸血鬼被彻底灭族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is said that the Western Coven was utterly destroyed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.87,0:07:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你能活着逃出来真是老天庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a blessing you escaped with your life.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.32,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很多都死在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, many did not.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.94,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经牺牲了太多族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has been too much death among our people.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.28,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,布达佩斯族一支就剩下这些骨灰盒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These urns are all that remain of our Budapest Coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.71,0:08:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请节哀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you have my condolences.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.56,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯 我们要输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are losing the war, Thomas.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.62,0:08:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们坐以待毙 不出五年 吸血鬼就都被灭族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we stay as we are, our species will be extinct within five years.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯同意你的观点吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Cassius share your view?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.20,0:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,狼族重整旗鼓 整装待发 决意要将我们赶尽杀绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycans have regrouped, replenished, and are resolved to exterminate us.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.20,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你在这儿很安全 东支防线牢固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, surely, you're safe here. The Eastern Coven is a fortress.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今日不同往昔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are no longer the coven you remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,死神使者少得不能再少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have fewer Death Dealers than ever before.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.04,0:08:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你身边这些都是新人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be surrounded by new cadets.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚招进来的 不仅格斗经验欠缺 数量也不足以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raw recruits, neither combat-ready nor numerous enough...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抵御狼人大规模进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to repel a large-scale Lycan attack.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.80,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人从未大举进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has never been a large-scale Lycan attack.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,至少没有一次协调有度的进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least not a coordinated one.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯这号人物 在狼族史上倒是头一次出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has never been a Marius.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.20,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽不愿承认 但我这辈子头次…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pains me to admit it, but for the first time in my life...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.14,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真正为我们的未来忧心不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I genuinely fear for our future.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有什么打算？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is your plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.99,0:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉 你向来胸有成竹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semira, you always have a plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你整这么一出 绝对是言在此而意在彼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This little mise-en-scene you're performing has a purpose.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.57,0:09:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅长猜别人的心思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a mind reader.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看在我这个老不死吸血鬼的份上 你就行行好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kindly do an old vampire the courtesy...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我他为什么会来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of telling him why he's been invited here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.40,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们不能停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We need to keep moving.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.09,0:09:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还有比这里更近的安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are safe houses far closer than this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是告诉过你了么 屋子都被他们毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, they destroyed them.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在情况不同了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's different now. Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但你在她的死亡执行书上签过字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you signed her death warrant.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 我并不喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. I despise her.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她杀了维克托 我是他的摄政者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She killed Viktor. I was his regent.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他遇见赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until he met Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是想让她追杀马吕斯了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want her to hunt Marius?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.03,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让她训练新人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want her to train our new recruits...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.56,0:09:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就有一百名死神使者 追杀马吕斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so we have 100 Death Dealers hunting Marius.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.30,0:09:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我怀疑她会不会同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt she will agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她唯一担心的是自己的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her only concern is for her daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.52,0:09:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,伊芙 也就是那个混血儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eve, the hybrid.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.52,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 这个可怜的女孩是半个狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, the poor girl is half Lycan.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.06,0:09:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说向狼人让步是吸血鬼的本性 但他们也不怕进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a vampire's instinct to condescend to Lycans, but they're not afraid to evolve.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,同时 我们居然为了"血统纯正" 这个狗屁理由…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, we stagnate from 1500 years...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,整整一千五百年没有进化 真是没道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of this damned "species purity" nonsense.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,讽刺的是 赛琳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the irony is that Selene...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.10,0:10:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是最纯种的吸血鬼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is probably the purest of us all.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.05,0:10:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说谣言都是真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the rumour's true?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她身上流着柯文纳斯家族的血？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her blood has elements of the Corvinus strain?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.67,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她很特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is special.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她让我儿子起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She brought my son back from the dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.16,0:10:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她的血让他的心脏又跳了起来 - 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Her blood restarted his heart. - Impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.60,0:10:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼所见 她救了我儿子的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I witnessed it myself. She saved my son's life.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,维克托和艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor and Amelia.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,并肩永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side by side for eternity.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.84,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没记错的话 你非常喜欢艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were very fond of Amelia, if I remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你在此事上支持我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to be my ally on this.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有得到所有委员的邀请…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't risk coming here...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.00,0:10:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会冒险回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...unless she gets an invitation from the whole council.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.73,0:10:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而我无权就此事向委员会提出申请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I could never solicit such a request.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.23,0:10:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯是个守旧派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cassius is protective of the old ways.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我踏足委员会已经够让他不爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He barely tolerates my seat on the council as it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可是托马斯 现在是非常时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these are desperate times, Thomas.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.73,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你必须说服委员会邀请她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is why you must convince the council to invite her.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.09,0:11:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们今晚就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They arrive tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯 各个部族的领袖们都已经到了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius, the pack leaders have arrived...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他们在战情室等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I told them to wait for you in the war room.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.70,0:11:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定吵成一锅粥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fighting like dogs, no doubt.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来处理 谢了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll handle it. Thank you. - All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续 - 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go on, then. - Right, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come around, come around.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.33,0:11:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Listen to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先把他们引进来 这就是我们的战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna wedge them in. That's what we do.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,从这边到那边 我们把他们引进来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From this side and that side, we just wedge them in...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.93,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后左右夹击 - 把他们引进来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and squeeze them out. - Wedge them in?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.87,0:12:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？根本不可行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your plan? It's not going to lead to anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要生气了 - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's getting angry. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.56,0:12:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.70,0:12:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是奴隶吗？- 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you a slave? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.61,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别表现得像个奴隶一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then don't behave like one.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这张地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this map.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都看到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有没有注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人争夺的 都是一些无关紧要的据点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Lycans fighting over scraps?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.40,0:12:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沃里尼亚地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Volhynia.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.80,0:12:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,诺德高地区 图林根地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nordgau. Thuringia.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.22,0:12:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人在以上地区取胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycan victories.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到吸血鬼横尸遍野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see vampires dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,整个地区的吸血鬼都被灭族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see entire regions annihilated.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们现在还内斗不止 是不会有什么出路的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we will get no further if we fight amongst ourselves.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在摧毁他们最后的庇护区之前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must not rest...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.68,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能停歇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...until we have destroyed their final sanctuary.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.48,0:12:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们团结在一起 就能坚不可摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we are strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.12,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能得到那个混血女孩的血…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we have the blood of the hybrid girl...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.53,0:12:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将无往不胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we will be invincible.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.87,0:13:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷戈尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregor.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你一人活着回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have returned alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.21,0:13:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们受到伏击 - 赛琳呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were taken by surprise. - Where is Selene?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她没杀我 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She spared me. - Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她让我替她转达一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To deliver a message.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她想让你知道 她的女儿已经永远消失了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants you to know that her daughter is gone forever...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.19,0:13:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都找不到她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you can never find her...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.65,0:13:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为连她自己都不知她被藏在何处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because even Selene doesn't know where she's been hidden.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.96,0:13:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你信她的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe her?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你信吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe her?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我在她同伴的身上放了跟踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put a tracer in her companion.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.44,0:13:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.08,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你还算有点用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that means you're not completely incompetent.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.58,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,站着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and stay still.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.65,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 一种子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - It's some sort of bullet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它能从你身上穿过去 根本不给你愈合的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's burrowing through you faster than you can heal.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,它自带动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's self-propelled.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.56,0:14:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我想告诉你们的是 狼人作战经验丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I was trying to tell you. These Lycans are sophisticated.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道能否及时把子弹取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I can remove it in time.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你可以装作一副让人安心的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the least you can do is attempt to sound reassuring.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会努力控制自己不把你杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to attempt not to kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.07,0:14:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will have to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我们保护和赦免谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To whom do you want us to offer safe haven and amnesty?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,死神使者赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Selene the Death Dealer.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个杀死维克托的赛琳？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same Selene who murdered Viktor?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.44,0:15:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯 这事儿你没必要提醒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need no reminder, Cassius, of what she has done.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.97,0:15:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你真是无耻啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame on you, sir.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.41,0:15:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别再向我提起她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not hear her name spoken again.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯 你的愤怒我感同身受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cassius, I share your outrage.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你中邪了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever has possessed you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不采取果断行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't act decisively...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.86,0:15:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不出两星期 狼人就打到家门口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the war will be at your gate within a fortnight.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.83,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也就只能打到门口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is precisely where it will remain.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.44,0:15:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人才不敢袭击我们这一族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Lycan pack would dare to attack our coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的防御能力会让他们死无葬身之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our defences would rip them apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一般的狼人部族或许会这样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ordinary Lycan pack, perhaps...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.36,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但马吕斯这次召集的部队 实力超过以往任何一次…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but Marius has gathered a force far more powerful than any...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.21,0:15:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unsubstantiated hyperbole.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.30,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她卓尔不群 领导能力非凡 对狼人有着深刻的了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her prowess, her leadership, her intimate knowledge of Lycans.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.23,0:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她的格斗术无人能敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her combat skills are second to none.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.57,0:15:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得对 她是迄今为止最具杀伤力的死神使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right, she is the most lethal Death Dealer we've ever had.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但她杀死过自己的族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she killed one of her own.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.17,0:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是最有权力 最受尊崇的长老…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only the most powerful and respected of the Elders...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.32,0:16:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还是她的守护者 待她如同亲生女儿一样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...her protector, who loved her like his own daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不信任她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cannot be trusted.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.81,0:16:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经被定了罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has been judged.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.15,0:16:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们还能再给她一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps she can also be redeemed.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.84,0:16:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽不愿承认 但托马斯说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It pains me to say it, but Thomas is right.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她是战场上最英勇的武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No warrior has proved herself more in battle.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.64,0:16:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她会成为我们抵抗马吕斯的宝贵力量…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She would be invaluable in our fight against Marius...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.28,0:16:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至会成为我们取胜的关键因素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...perhaps even the pivotal element to secure our victory.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们能找到她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she can be found...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.02,0:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且并把她带回我们宝贵的营地…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and sets foot within this precious coven...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉 她的行为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will hold you, Semira, personally responsible...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 将由你个人完全负责 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...for controlling her. - Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.00,0:17:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.10,0:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.22,0:17:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我们的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you find us?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.85,0:17:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的安全屋不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are only a handful of safe houses left.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.59,0:17:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人反倒是帮了忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycans made it rather easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.17,0:17:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,东族委员会让我带你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council of the Eastern Coven sent me to bring you in.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.81,0:17:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是要审判我吗？- 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For trial? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.60,0:17:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你的安全 也为了我们的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your safety, and ours.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.73,0:17:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的话我可不敢信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot expect me to believe that.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都曾在我的死刑执行书上签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single one of them signed my death warrant.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 情况变了 - 但吸血鬼不会变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Times change. - Vampires do not.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你父亲写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is from your father.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.56,0:18:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是他的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it authentic?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他的印章 他的字迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his seal, his handwriting.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.83,0:18:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会决定宽恕你 并且保证咱俩的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council has offered you clemency and granted us both safe haven.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.32,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 因为马吕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Marius.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会真诚邀请你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the council's humble request...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,训练我们的部队 好打败马吕斯和他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you train us to defeat him and his army.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.89,0:18:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快点啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move. Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,信号是这边传过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The signal's coming from this way.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.47,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你不愿意…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I understand you're reluctant...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.35,0:18:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但作为委员会请来的客人 我们受到法律的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but as guests of the council, we will be protected by law.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.08,0:18:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲不会说谎 而且他绝无恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father wouldn't lie, and he holds no grudge.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 - 你应该接受委员会的邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We must leave. - You should accept the council's offer.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了伊芙 - 伊芙不需要我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For Eve. - Eve does not want my help.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想保护她 如果我们能打败马吕斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you want to protect her. And if we destroy Marius...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.69,0:18:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就等于是消除了对伊芙最大的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we destroy the greatest threat to her safety.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.13,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.20,0:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.80,0:19:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们刚刚走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just missed them.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.32,0:19:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我再听到"刚刚"这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not wish to hear the word "just" again.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要是找不到她 我们将一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either we have her or we have nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.99,0:19:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.35,0:20:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎 - 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome. - Am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.80,0:20:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,营地内所有的资源和武器随你调遣…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our coven's resources and weaponry are yours...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.72,0:20:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些新来的转变成 不会有辱你名声的死神使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to transform these raw recruits into Death Dealers worthy of your name.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加负责协助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga will be your right-hand man.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我们的优势和劣势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows all our strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.46,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是我们最多产的狼人杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is also our most prolific Lycan killer...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.58,0:20:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一共有四十多个狼人死在他手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with over 40 confirmed kills.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的荣幸 - 大卫 欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's an honour. - David, welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 为了欢迎客人们平安到来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - To mark the safe arrival of our guests...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我在冬日花园安排了小型舞会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I've arranged a little soiree in the Winter Garden.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.09,0:20:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真没这个必要 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's really no need. Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.71,0:20:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么呢 及时行乐么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonsense. There's always a need to indulge in pleasure.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是在战争时期…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In times of war...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.88,0:21:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,族人更需要喜乐的气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this coven needs moments to celebrate.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.11,0:21:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯 大卫和赛琳的到来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The arrival of Thomas, David and Selene...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.32,0:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这理由足以使我们庆祝一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is reason aplenty to rejoice.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为所有人干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us all.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.30,0:21:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉 你能收留我们真是太好了 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good of you to offer us sanctuary, Semira. Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.71,0:21:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be entirely my pleasure.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.52,0:21:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 她的血真的令你起死回生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, is it true that her blood brought you back to life?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.53,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.05,0:21:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我这条命都是她的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe her everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.66,0:21:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我父亲让我过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, if you'll excuse me, my father requests my counsel.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.60,0:21:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯一直都这么无趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas was always such a bore.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.15,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉显然对你很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Semira's certainly taken an interest in you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.53,0:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只可惜这兴趣不是双向的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the interest is certainly not mutual.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.54,0:21:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要她的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need her protection.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.92,0:22:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反 我觉得我需要防着点她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary, I think I need protection from her.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.90,0:22:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,瘟疫之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Battle of the Peste.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.04,0:22:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都以为那会是战争结束前的最后一搏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought it would be the one to end the war...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.35,0:22:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,终极一战…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the final conflict...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.98,0:22:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,结果到现在依然混战不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but here we are still.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.37,0:22:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you see...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.23,0:22:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了让委员会宽恕赛琳所付出的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my bid for clemency for Selene for what it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.76,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你都把她女儿交易给了狼人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, clemency is the least you can offer her...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.66,0:22:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为她求得委员会的宽恕 不是你最该做的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after bartering her daughter to the Lycans.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.68,0:22:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,战争夺去我太多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost so much during this war.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.32,0:22:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我辜负了太多人 直到现在都无法释怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I am haunted still by all those I failed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.81,0:22:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那你必须帮我保护好她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you must help me protect her.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.07,0:22:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她所失去的要远比我们想象得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has lost even more than we can imagine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.81,0:22:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她对我来说很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's important to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.94,0:22:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如今马吕斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius is out there...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.25,0:22:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,刚愎自用 根本不把咱们放在眼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...reeking of canine insolence,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他预谋将我们灭族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plotting our downfall.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.45,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,想要摧毁马吕斯 我们根本用不着赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not need Selene to destroy him.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.36,0:22:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有我一人就足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am more than capable.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.87,0:23:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 维尔加 你只能算勉强够格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Varga, you are merely adequate.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.56,0:23:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 为了求得生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fortunate that we're not forced to rely on your skills...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.97,0:23:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不用被迫依靠你的本领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for our survival.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.70,0:23:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而这个 我亲爱的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, my sweet...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,然而和缺乏想象力的人做朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...yet unimaginative bedfellow...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.25,0:23:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,恰好是我的专长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is my area of expertise.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.45,0:23:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你应该… - 千万别那么想 维尔加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think you should... - Don't think, Varga.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.88,0:23:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你会伤到自己的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.45,0:23:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有其他方式可以证明自己的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other ways to prove your devotion.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.83,0:23:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,各个击破…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece by delicate piece...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谜底最终会浮出水面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the puzzle will fall into place.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.35,0:23:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没错…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.60,0:23:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.02,0:24:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不要等狼人到了之后才行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't aim where the Lycan is.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.36,0:24:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要抢在他们前面动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anticipate.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.32,0:24:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember...
Dialogue: 1,0:24:37.62,0:24:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人恢复原形时最容易受到攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a Lycan is never more vulnerable than when he's in wolf form.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.31,0:24:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没道理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.63,0:24:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦变回狼形 他们就无法使用武器…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In wolf form, they cannot use weapons...
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.41,0:24:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的想法更加原始…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and their thinking becomes much more primitive...
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.77,0:24:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,纯粹被杀戮的欲望支配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...driven only by bloodlust.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.32,0:24:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你杀过多少狼人？- 我没记过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many have you killed? - I don't keep track.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.56,0:24:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把狼人的速度加快百分之二十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm increasing Lycan speed by 20 percent.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.66,0:24:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please continue.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:04.79,0:25:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的部族探测过东族吸血鬼的营地…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pack has probed the Eastern Coven's perimeter...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:06.83,0:25:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,, 意图找到他们的防守弱区 却一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for weaknesses and there are none.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.58,0:25:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,任何明取便会引发他们的一级防范…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And any direct assault would trigger the lockdown...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.75,0:25:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候营地就变得固若金汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which makes the coven impregnable.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.49,0:25:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,即便我们还能有百分之九十的人打进去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if we could break inside without losing 90 percent of our force...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.64,0:25:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们还有撤退点… - 这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...they have fallback positions... - This.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.86,0:25:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以用来… - 准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...that can be... - Is this ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:20.06,0:25:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.84,0:25:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我们拿到混血儿的血…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we have the hybrid's blood...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:24.34,0:25:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,马上发动对东部营地的进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we launch against the Eastern.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:26.32,0:25:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,找到赛琳 就能找到她女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Selene, and we find her daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:33.62,0:25:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我发明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My own invention.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.74,0:25:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,死神使者最先要学会的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the first things a Death Dealer must learn...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.41,0:25:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是如何在受限的空间内决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is how to fight in a confined space.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.03,0:25:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 实际打斗中充满不确定性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, the one thing this training session lacks...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是我们训练课程的不足之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is unpredictability.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.81,0:25:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你愿意帮我给我的学生们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'll indulge me and give my students...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.36,0:25:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说是给你的学生们上一堂课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should say your students a lesson...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:48.81,0:25:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,专门讲格斗的突发状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in combat's unpredictability.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.06,0:25:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不仅咱俩能过过招 对他们的训练也是极其有益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would not only honour us, but it would be invaluable to their training.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.81,0:25:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想… - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't... - Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.44,0:25:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.09,0:26:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都聚过来 我们让你们见识一下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather round. We are going to school you...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:04.56,0:26:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的狼人勇士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the true nature of the Lycan warrior.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.56,0:26:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,为了给你们上这堂课 我们尊贵的客人赛琳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the sake of this lesson, our esteemed guest Selene...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:11.65,0:26:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,会作为死神使者 英勇守卫我们的据点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will play the role of Death Dealer bravely defending our fortress...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.68,0:26:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而我将扮作前来摧毁据点的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I will take the role of Lycan villain...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.24,0:26:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,狼族恶人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...here to destroy it.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:20.90,0:26:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.27,0:26:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.25,0:26:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:58.91,0:26:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.07,0:27:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚课程的主题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight's lesson:
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.42,0:27:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,打斗过程中 千万不要认为你的对手是正人君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not trust your opponent to fight with honour.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.13,0:27:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是狼人 毫无底线可言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are Lycan. They have none.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.60,0:27:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.08,0:28:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,龙葵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nightshade.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.01,0:28:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦进入吸血鬼的细胞 通常来说都是致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leeches into vampire cells, usually fatal.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:05.75,0:28:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但对于她这种体能比较好的吸血鬼 只会引发疼痛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for one with her strength, there will only be pain...
Dialogue: 1,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,接着是四肢麻痹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...followed by paralysis.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.82,0:28:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:13.39,0:28:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,紫外线子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UV bullets.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:21.08,0:28:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你真以为我会原谅你杀了维克托？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you honestly think I would forgive you for killing Viktor?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:24.71,0:28:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加 你军令在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga, you have orders.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.75,0:28:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:01.21,0:29:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不需要你来训练死神使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need you to train Death Dealers.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.40,0:29:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有维尔加训练就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have Varga for that.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:05.48,0:29:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我若想统治这一族…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that I need to rule this coven...
Dialogue: 1,0:29:07.94,0:29:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,并阻止狼人的进攻 有你的血就足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and end the march of the Lycans is your blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:20.13,0:29:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那尸体呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the bodies?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.92,0:29:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,敲响警钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound the alarm.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.89,0:29:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让委员会去找吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the council find them.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.28,0:29:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体都是赛琳施暴的铁证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conclusive evidence of the atrocity committed by Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.92,0:29:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有人谋反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a breach.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:45.04,0:29:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要找到赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.12,0:29:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 封锁这里 塞米拉的命令 - 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cordoned off. Semira's orders. - Step aside.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.86,0:29:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:55.49,0:29:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.04,0:29:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,营地里肯定还有其他的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more than one way to move around this coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.32,0:30:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这些走道是艾米莉亚几百年前建造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia created these passageways centuries ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.56,0:30:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这条路通到哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does this lead?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:08.52,0:30:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,私人房间 包括塞米拉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the private chambers, including Semira's.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:38.28,0:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到底对她做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell have they done to her?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,流尽身体之血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Machina sanguinem exhauri.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.29,0:30:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloodletting.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.28,0:30:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉想得到赛琳最珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semira wants Selene's most precious asset.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.40,0:30:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这样她必死无疑 - 是的 没错…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is going to kill her. - Eventually, yes...
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.37,0:30:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但整个过程漫长而又痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it will be agonisingly slow.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:03.31,0:31:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:05.31,0:31:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西是用来扩张动脉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is designed to open the arteries as wide as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.48,0:31:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦不小心 我们就会伤害到她 而不是在帮她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're not very careful, we will do her more harm than good.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.57,0:31:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.43,0:31:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是她的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this hers?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.64,0:31:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.38,0:31:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳只用这种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene uses only this particular weapon.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:39.80,0:31:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼内部臭名昭著的叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A known traitor within our walls.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:41.95,0:31:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟我预想的一模一样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is precisely what I foresaw...
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.92,0:31:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你也向我保证会阻止这一切的发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and what you assured me you would prevent.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.47,0:31:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的命都算在你头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their blood is upon your hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:49.27,0:31:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 我尽力了… - 别跟我废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, I did everything... - Do not speak to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.69,0:31:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对她不能有一丝仁慈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can be no mercy.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:52.97,0:31:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,天涯海角 你们也得给我把她追到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want her hunted to the ends of the Earth.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:55.68,0:31:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shall be done.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:59.20,0:32:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把她给我活捉回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want her captured alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:03.83,0:32:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,明白？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that understood?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.20,0:32:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:18.04,0:32:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们没时间了 - 好的 带上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're running out of time. - All right, take her.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.92,0:32:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须北上 去遥远的北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go north, far north.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:22.08,0:32:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦尔·道尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Var Dohr.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.64,0:32:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.64,0:32:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,父子合伙叛国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father and son united in treason.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟赛琳先走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on with Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:31.84,0:32:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我来对付他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll deal with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:42.40,0:32:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.65,0:32:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Now!
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.66,0:32:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.56,0:33:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,继续啊 你或选择被阳光灼烧 灰飞烟灭…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. The sun will burn you to ashes out there...
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.40,0:33:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,或选择有尊严地死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or you can die with some grace in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:45.17,0:33:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不怕光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can walk in the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.32,0:34:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,失了那么多血 你得补充体能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to feed. You've lost too much blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.38,0:34:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那个孩子… 因为他帮过你的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That child... Because he helped that child of yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:27.96,0:34:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子死了 死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son is dead. Dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:31.45,0:34:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.44,0:34:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,带她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her now.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:34.51,0:34:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须去北方 去找瓦尔·道尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go north. Var Dohr.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.00,0:34:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊 赶紧走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Now!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:53.30,0:34:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:58.77,0:35:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾你失去了父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry that you lost your father.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:02.98,0:35:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他打了一场硬仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He put up a valiant fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.98,0:35:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,失去一个你从未真正了解的人 感觉怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's strange to lose someone you feel like you never really knew.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.24,0:35:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈去世时就是这样 可…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel the same about my mother, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:35:14.59,0:35:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我对她毫无印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have almost no memory of her.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.55,0:35:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我对伊芙也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I of Eve.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不希望她来到这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want her.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:22.84,0:35:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不了解她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know her.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:25.40,0:35:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我也失去了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I've lost her.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:26.56,0:35:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么一直说失去她了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you insist on saying that you've lost her?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:29.32,0:35:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她让我保证永远不会找她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made me promise I would never look for her...
Dialogue: 1,0:35:33.01,0:35:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,让我忘了自己有个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I would never consider myself having a daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:36.64,0:35:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她这么做是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she was right.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:39.48,0:35:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱过的人都没什么好下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing good has come to anyone I love.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:42.64,0:35:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的家人 是我唯一的牵挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're family, and you're all I have left.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:48.59,0:35:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那你真的有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, you really are in trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:52.34,0:35:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.03,0:36:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳明显是跟狼人结盟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene's clearly in league with the Lycans.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.75,0:36:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,叛变都是托马斯和大卫串通好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas and David were complicit in this treachery.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:08.42,0:36:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不怕阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They walked in the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:09.51,0:36:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,单单这一点就能证明他们跟狼人勾结到了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This alone is evidence of Lycan collusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:12.26,0:36:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须在光荣史册上将赛琳除名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene must be wiped from the pages of our proud history.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:15.35,0:36:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,亚力克西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexia.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:16.94,0:36:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要为死去的同胞复仇 - 请务必小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We shall avenge our fallen. - See to it that you do.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.84,0:36:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你用了多少龙葵？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much nightshade did you use?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.06,0:36:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我之所以犯错 主要是考虑…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it best to err on the side...
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.21,0:36:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加 关于"你是怎么考虑的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga, what have we said...
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.96,0:36:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前是怎么跟你说的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about you thinking?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,毒药会扩散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The poison will dissipate.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:54.52,0:36:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要没有任何污染的血 现在就要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need this blood untainted, and I need it now.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:58.09,0:36:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不能心急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It cannot be rushed.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:00.73,0:37:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事得慢漫来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must run its course.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:06.52,0:37:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's definitely the car.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:08.57,0:37:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知道他们去了哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no sign of where they went.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.49,0:37:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们分开搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread out across the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:14.26,0:37:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个角落都不能放过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.48,0:37:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Northbound.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:59.41,0:38:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的力量会超过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be more powerful...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.46,0:38:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,卡西乌斯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than Cassius...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.79,0:38:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,以及东族任何一个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than any vampire in this coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.66,0:38:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搜查有什么进展吗？- 赛琳和大卫往北边逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What news of the search? - Selene and David are heading north.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:20.36,0:38:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想当然他们也会 - 大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course they are. - Your Grace?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:23.12,0:38:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会去投靠唯一存留的支族…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will run to the only remaining coven...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:24.90,0:38:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,寻求庇护 瓦尔·道儿 北欧防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to afford them safe haven: Var Dohr, the Nordic fortress.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:28.44,0:38:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但瓦尔·道尔只是个传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Var Dohr is only a legend.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:30.57,0:38:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会如此抬举北欧防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not give it such an elevated status.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:32.87,0:38:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿冰天雪地 穷乡僻野 挤满了可悲 偏安的懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a frigid, dreary outpost full of pathetic, peace-loving cowards.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:37.92,0:38:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来好像你去过那儿一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak of it as if you have actually been there.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:40.03,0:38:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不然维克托错宠赛琳那些年 你以为我去哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think I was when Viktor wasted years with Selene?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:47.79,0:38:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,长路漫漫 你需要独自行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The journey's long, and I need you to take it alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:51.38,0:38:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果冒险出动一个班的死神使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must be certain the traitor's there...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:53.92,0:38:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,, 把他们派到离我们那么远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before I risk sending a full squad of Death Dealers...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:56.05,0:38:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须确定叛徒是在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so far from this coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.20,0:39:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你要额外小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:40.44,0:39:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你得温柔一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be more gentle.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:46.60,0:39:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到赛琳了吗？- 找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you found Selene? - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:48.27,0:39:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,她逃往北欧支族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is headed for the Nordic Coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:52.96,0:39:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,为此我付出了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I risk everything for this.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.64,0:39:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了你 为了我们 - 我知道 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For you, for us. - I know, my love.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:59.84,0:40:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉日渐一日贪图权势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semira grows more insane for power with each day.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.16,0:40:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must be stopped.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.88,0:40:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天担惊受怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every day, I fear more...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:05.99,0:40:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,生怕我们暴露了 都不知她会做出什么事出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what she will do if we are discovered.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.74,0:40:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不到混血儿的血 我没办法攻击吸血鬼东部支族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot attack the Eastern Coven without the blood of the hybrid.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.92,0:40:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们力量太强 即便是我自己的部族也没把握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too strong, even for my horde.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:17.91,0:40:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.16,0:40:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她决定着狼人的未来 也决定着吸血鬼的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is the key to the futures of Lycans and vampires alike.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:24.94,0:40:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall have her.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.26,0:40:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦尔·道尔部族就在山脊那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Var Dohr is just beyond that ridge.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:57.49,0:42:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.16,0:43:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,都看着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:09.31,0:43:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来寻求庇护的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We come seeking sanctuary...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:11.92,0:43:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是来打架的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not to fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:14.49,0:43:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们算是来对了地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you've come to the right place.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.08,0:43:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫莉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Lena.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:24.23,0:43:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.17,0:43:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:28.96,0:43:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,障眼法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.00,0:43:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定就是赛琳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.85,0:44:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的死神使者 真的是为了和平而来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the great Death Dealer truly come in peace?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.08,0:44:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 那他是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do. - And what about this one?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:05.21,0:44:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他是大卫 托马斯的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is David, son of Thomas.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.63,0:44:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经好多年没见到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I haven't seen for many, many years.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.18,0:44:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别介意他们盯着你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must excuse the attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:16.00,0:44:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们支族很少有客人到访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our coven doesn't receive many guests, by design.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:19.42,0:44:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们顺从自己的意愿行事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do as we wish...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.71,0:44:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 并不理会他人的想法 - 那狼人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...not as others would have us do. - And what of the Lycans?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:23.26,0:44:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离得太远 他们压根不会在意我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are too far removed for them to take notice...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:25.87,0:44:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,即便有兴趣 他们也受不了这里的酷寒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and even if they did, our climate is quite an obstacle to warm-bloods.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:30.67,0:44:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要是没有你母亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This coven wouldn't exist...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:33.17,0:44:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 北欧支族早就不存在了 - 你知道我母亲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...without your mother's grace. - You knew my mother?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.76,0:44:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼界无人不知 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All vampires do, my boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:37.27,0:44:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我母亲出身卑微 她生我的时候难产死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. My mother was low-born. She died giving birth to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:39.76,0:44:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的 你迟早会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A falsehood, you will find,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.33,0:44:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了隐蔽你的真实身份而编的谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}designed to keep your true lineage safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:43.40,0:44:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那她还活着吗？- 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she still alive? - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:45.52,0:44:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她的死令所有吸血鬼沉恸不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her death was a terrible blow to our kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:48.46,0:44:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为她举办的哀悼仪式 整整持续了一个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mourning ceremony we held lasted for an entire month.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.48,0:44:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的荣耀通常只有出身高贵的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such an honour is usually reserved for a high-born...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.35,0:44:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大长老才能享受到 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...a Grand Elder. - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:58.38,0:45:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾米莉亚 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amelia. - Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:00.38,0:45:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲怎么会是大长老…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could a Grand Elder have been my mother...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.20,0:45:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,而且居然没人告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I not been told?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:04.89,0:45:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.37,0:45:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你父亲最伟大的发明 里面灌了银水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's greatest work, infused with silver.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:26.16,0:45:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人看到它便会退避三舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycans will cower from the very sight of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.87,0:45:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好美啊 - 托马斯知道总有一天…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's beautiful. - Thomas knew that one day...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.52,0:45:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被吸血鬼和狼人同时围攻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you would be beset by enemies on both sides...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.01,0:45:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他预想得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he was right.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.24,0:45:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 这意味着你才是东部支族的合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, this means that you are the rightful heir of the Eastern Coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.96,0:45:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母在这里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother and father spent many months...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:41.84,0:45:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,安全地待了好几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...within the safety of these walls.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:44.32,0:45:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,维克托起了疑心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor grew suspicious.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.90,0:45:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你父亲在塞米拉和她的军队到来之前…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your father spirited you away...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:48.59,0:45:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把你送了出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before Semira arrived with her troops.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.16,0:45:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我母亲呢？- 她回到了东部支族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what of my mother? - She returned to the Eastern Coven.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.34,0:45:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她眼睛里散发出来的光…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The light in her eyes...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.59,0:45:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡编她是什么殉道士了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try and fabricate some kind of martyrdom for her.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.16,0:46:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是实实在在地对她的决定 做出评价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer a more honest appraisal of her decision.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.73,0:46:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她为了自己那宝贵的委员会 抛弃了唯一的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She abandoned her only son for the sake of her precious council.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.37,0:46:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿着 - 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it. - David.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.82,0:46:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾米莉亚让我把这个交给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia asked me to give him this.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.17,0:46:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.35,0:46:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也不要 我只想单独待会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. I just need to be left alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.16,0:46:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我理解你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:40.49,0:46:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那我父亲为什么不跟我说母亲的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't my father tell me about my mother?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:42.89,0:46:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是很了解你父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not know your father well...
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.37,0:46:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道他最怕失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I know that his greatest fear was to lose you.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.90,0:46:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,父母总是让孩子失望 好像每个家庭都是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems it's the curse of every parent to disappoint their child.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:51.04,0:46:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你会为自己的孩子而战 赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you fought for your child, Selene.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.96,0:46:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 但我还是失去了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and lost.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:54.96,0:46:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 你血统纯正 是最合法的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have pure-blood heritage, David.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲是位长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother was an Elder.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:58.36,0:47:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母这样保护你 肯定有他们自己的苦衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents kept you safe for a reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:00.67,0:47:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只有保护好你 将来你才能统领东部支族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They protected you so that one day you could lead.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:05.72,0:47:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲留给你一件礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother left you a gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:10.54,0:47:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你人真好 可我不喜欢珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's very kind of you, but I have no use for jewellery.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.82,0:47:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这枚戒指不是我所说的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ring is not the gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:15.40,0:47:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,礼物蕴藏在戒指里 那便是你母亲对你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It contains the gift: a mother's love.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:19.21,0:47:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她的一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single drop of her blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.59,0:47:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也许它会帮你做出决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it'll help you decide.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.72,0:48:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你来得刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just in time.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.85,0:48:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 这里是什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come. - What is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.84,0:48:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瓦利萨 中间地带 - 她死了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Valissa, the in-between place. - Is she dead?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:08.18,0:48:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.98,0:48:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:13.94,0:48:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,正在进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...becoming.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.84,0:48:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她服了毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took a poison.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:16.20,0:48:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,以便去到神圣世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It allows her to visit the Sacred World.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:18.86,0:48:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她回来之后 会对这个世界产生有新的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she returns, she will see this world with new eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.61,0:48:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不理解这怎么一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand what this is.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.12,0:48:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来 我们都知道第二世界的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have long known there is more than just this world.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.96,0:48:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲第一次带我来这儿的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my father first brought me down here...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.33,0:48:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你的反应一模一样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I felt as you do now...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:32.05,0:48:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但我后来多次去过神圣世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I have since been to the Sacred World many times.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:37.10,0:48:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到过许多常人看不到的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyes see beyond the surface of so many things.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.19,0:48:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看到过你很多次 - 比如说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I see much about you. - Such as?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.83,0:48:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你爱上一个狼人 杀死一位吸血鬼长老…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you've loved a Lycan, killed a vampire Elder...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:48.04,0:48:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 生下一个… - 别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and given birth... - Stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.08,0:48:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了你失去女儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you have lost your daughter...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:56.59,0:48:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事在你内心深处 留下深深的伤痕…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and how much pain this gives you deep inside...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:59.04,0:49:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然而你总是把痛苦深埋心底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where you will always hide it.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:05.09,0:49:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个特别的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a special child.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.47,0:49:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,很多战争会因她而起…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many battles will be fought...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.55,0:49:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因她而败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and lost over her.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.84,0:49:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还看到了什么？- 黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What else do you see? - Darkness.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.12,0:49:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,无边无际 笼罩在所有人头上的黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that touches us all.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:16.16,0:49:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想让她安全 就得继续前行…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to keep her safe, you will need to go further...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.16,0:49:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,突破自己作为一名勇士的极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than even a warrior of your renown has ever ventured before.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:24.56,0:49:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我看过太多战争…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen so much war...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.58,0:49:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,太多杀戮…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so much killing.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:29.60,0:49:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也无法忍受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot bear more.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.92,0:49:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里感受到的和平都是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace you will feel here is real.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:33.62,0:49:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它渗入你的肌肤 抚慰你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seeps into your skin and comforts your soul.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.08,0:49:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说神圣世界吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the Sacred World.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.84,0:49:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,水流便是通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water is the path.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.65,0:50:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人来了 快敲响警钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycans! Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:40.26,0:50:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the doors!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:42.01,0:50:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.03,0:50:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚说完和平 战争就跟着你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as I spoke of peace, war has followed you here.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:53.72,0:50:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect your own.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.00,0:50:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要找到大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must find David.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.17,0:51:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得把你送走 - 不 狼人是我们引来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to get you away. - No. We led the Lycans here.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:08.08,0:51:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能眼睁睁看着人们送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let these people die.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.76,0:52:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.16,0:52:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, men.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:24.10,0:52:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去那边看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go around that side.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:01.39,0:53:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.18,0:53:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个寄生虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You parasite.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:25.79,0:53:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:25.55,0:54:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.28,0:54:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,终于见到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.92,0:54:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your right!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.72,0:55:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的可不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expected more from you.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:48.84,0:55:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你女儿在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where your daughter is.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:51.71,0:55:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.06,0:55:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳 我只要她的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene, all I want is her blood.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.96,0:56:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只有她能结束这场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only she can end this war.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:12.12,0:56:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证 她不会被杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you my word she will not be killed.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:44.03,0:56:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你算老几？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:06.91,0:58:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他她在哪儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him where she is...
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.23,0:58:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所有杀戮就能永远结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and all this butchery will be over forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.96,0:58:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.92,0:58:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lies.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:21.64,0:58:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:36.90,0:58:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她没说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:41.08,0:58:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她确实不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.39,0:58:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做的都做完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time is done.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:08.37,0:59:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are retreating.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:16.40,0:59:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我快没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:18.44,0:59:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须对东部支族发起进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must strike against the Eastern Coven now.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.60,0:59:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道自己必须怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you must do.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:34.95,0:59:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,水流便是通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water is the path.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:09.56,1:00:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:54.19,1:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.76,1:01:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:01.08,1:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,简单又极具诱惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a seductively simple thing.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.15,1:01:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要么无所不有 要么一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either you have it all or you have nothing.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:44.72,1:01:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好神奇啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fascinating.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:08.01,1:02:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该留在这儿 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should stay here, David.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.28,1:02:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以把这儿当做自己的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can be your home.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:12.73,1:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯朝东边去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius is heading east.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.34,1:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在什么都阻挡不住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing stopping him now.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:16.48,1:02:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的同胞四面受敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my people are beset with enemies on all sides.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.72,1:02:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么能在此苟活…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I stay here and live...
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.65,1:02:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 任由他们死去？- 他们需要领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...while they die? - They need a leader.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:44.58,1:02:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,想我了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss me?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:01.68,1:03:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么消息吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What news do you bring?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.58,1:03:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A massacre.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.76,1:03:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人袭击了瓦尔·道尔据点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycans attacked the fortress of Var Dohr.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.49,1:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人在北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycans in the north.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.36,1:03:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,北欧支族完全被他们打了个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nordic Coven was taken completely by surprise.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:15.70,1:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 死了不少吸血鬼 - 赛琳也死了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dozens of vampires have been killed. - Was Selene amongst them?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:19.68,1:03:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,死了 死在马吕斯手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead. Killed by Marius himself.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:22.94,1:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,赛琳真是个煞星 走哪儿哪儿倒霉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever Selene goes, trouble surely follows.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.83,1:03:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大卫呢？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What of David? - I do not know.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:28.33,1:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我能早来一会儿 说不定能帮上什么忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wished I had arrived sooner. I might have helped in some way.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.88,1:03:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经帮了不少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've helped in so many ways.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.56,1:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全达到了我对你的期待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done exactly as I hoped and planned, if not more.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.04,1:03:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看到没 信息就是力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, information is power.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.45,1:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是满怀激情收集的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I collect it with a passion.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.49,1:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你把马吕斯带去了北欧支族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for leading Marius to the Nordic Coven.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.84,1:04:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你的狼族爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Lycan lover...
Dialogue: 1,1:04:07.89,1:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯肯定为一时的胜利欢欣不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...must be delighted with his momentary success.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:12.32,1:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought I didn't know.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:17.50,1:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢丫头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foolish girl.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:35.09,1:04:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,整个支族都被狼人灭掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycan scourge destroyed an entire coven.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:38.92,1:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,藏在安全墙后使他们优势大增\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To hide behind these walls increases their advantage.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:41.27,1:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能跟马吕斯来硬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot take the war to Marius.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:43.40,1:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就这样藏在安全墙后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we cower in the safety of these walls...
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.24,1:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等着被他挨个灭掉？- 别说丧气话 塞米拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...while he picks us off one by one? - Curb your insidious comments, Semira.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:49.50,1:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这支族已经延续了一千五百年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This coven has held for 15 centuries.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:52.04,1:04:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再延续好几个一千五百年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will hold for 15 more.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:54.39,1:04:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我能勉强接受你的能力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped you would show strength...
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.07,1:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是希望你拿出实力来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...though I was willing to settle for competence.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.46,1:05:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前想错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.04,1:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:09.44,1:05:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果委员会太过孱弱 无法采取行动…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this council is too weak to take action...
Dialogue: 1,1:05:12.05,1:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那我便有义务这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it is my duty to do so.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:14.22,1:05:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你被废除委员会委员一职 即刻生效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are relieved of your duties as council members effective immediately.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.52,1:05:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,叛徒回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The traitor returns.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:26.56,1:05:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你傻了吧 居然还敢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you are a fool to show your face here.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:30.03,1:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,塞米拉 我要你血债血偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will make you pay for what you've done, Semira.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:32.34,1:05:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说话这会儿 马吕斯和他的部队就在来的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius and his army are heading this way as we speak.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:35.32,1:05:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我回来是为了拯救我的子民 - 你的子民？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I come to save my people. - Your people?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:38.25,1:05:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him. Kill him.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.42,1:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你渴求成为自己这一族的保护者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aspire to be the protector of your bloodline...
Dialogue: 1,1:05:42.62,1:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然而你为了争权夺势 不惜杀害自己的同胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...yet you kill your own kind in pursuit of power.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.49,1:05:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一切到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ends now.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:47.58,1:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是大卫 大长老艾米莉亚的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am David, son of the great Elder Amelia.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.65,1:05:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是东部支族的合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am the rightful heir to this coven.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:55.54,1:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,艾米莉亚根本没有儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia had no son.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:59.05,1:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她曾预见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she had the foresight...
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.90,1:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,会有人阻止我继承王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to know that my claim would be challenged.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:05.40,1:06:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,请拿给委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the council.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:22.43,1:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,艾米莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:37.76,1:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他是真正的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His claim is true.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:40.68,1:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫是纯正血统的最后一脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David is the last of the purebloods.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.80,1:06:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这并不重要 你寡不敌众 且装备不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irrelevant. You are outnumbered and outgunned.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.85,1:06:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加 继续执行我的命令 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga, your orders still remain. Kill him.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.17,1:06:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我让你杀了他 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said, "Kill him." - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:02.00,1:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你发誓效忠于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You swore to serve me.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.75,1:07:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓效忠于支族的首领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swore to protect the leader of this house.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.58,1:07:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在委员会审判之前把她关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock her away until she can be judged by the council.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.00,1:07:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她想要的战争终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gets her damn war after all.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.75,1:07:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,维尔加 再给你一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Varga, you can still be forgiven.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.59,1:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把她的嘴也堵上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gag her as well.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:52.10,1:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧的 开车啊 开啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move that truck. Move it.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:01.48,1:08:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,把握好角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your angles!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:04.57,1:08:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:29.40,1:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your positions.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:12.10,1:09:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 楼梯那儿 - 你身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On the staircase! - Behind you!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:19.35,1:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fall back! - Retreat!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:36.14,1:09:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,栏杆后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind the balustrades!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:37.93,1:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them out!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:52.43,1:09:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 行动 行动 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.52,1:09:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.12,1:10:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:08.93,1:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim at the ready!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:13.26,1:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:41.66,1:10:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.23,1:11:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,避开光照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide from the light!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:06.28,1:11:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,跑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:08.79,1:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:12.67,1:11:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪 开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot, shoot!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:43.08,1:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:44.96,1:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你就死在我眼皮子底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:46.68,1:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.56,1:12:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还带了后援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought backup.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:57.72,1:12:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are too many of them.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:21.32,1:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死在我手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already killed you.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.31,1:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,马吕斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marius!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:04.42,1:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你父亲能活着看到这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish your father was alive to see this.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:08.23,1:17:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他做梦都想不到 你成为支族领袖这件事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His ridiculous dream of you ruling this coven...
Dialogue: 1,1:17:10.33,1:17:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,会让你把命都搭上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will be the very thing that kills you.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:18.28,1:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missed.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:28.27,1:17:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有效果了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it worked.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:00.31,1:18:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm one of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:01.68,1:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:17.33,1:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed Michael.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.92,1:18:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而这是他唯一留下的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last of him.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:26.92,1:20:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的领袖已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your leader is dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:32.23,1:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,带着你们的伤员 赶紧离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your wounded. Leave.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.23,1:20:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave!
